      "sha1": "f1195a9b24c0c0477f4fdad8c241f05b81ed28b6",
      "snippet": "\n97 Wn.2d 30 (1982)\n640 P.2d 716\nSEATTLE TIMES COMPANY, Petitioner,\nv.\nRICHARD M. ISHIKAWA, as Judge of the Superior Court, Respondent. THE HEARST CORPORATION, Petitioner,\nv.\nRICHARD M. ISHIKAWA, as Judge of the Superior Court, Respondent.\nNos. 47604-7, 47623-3.\nThe Supreme Court of Washington, En Banc.\nFebruary 11, 1982.\nDavis, Wri",
      "type": "combined-opinion"
    },
    {
      "author_id": null,
