      "snippet": "\n\u00b621 (concurring) \u2014 Under the plain language of GR 15, the trial court erred in ordering the King County Superior Court clerk to replace the names of Ignacio Encarnaci\u00f3n and Norma Karla Farias with their initials in the SCOMIS (Superior Court Management Information System) index. Because GR 15 resolves this case, the lead opinion\u2019s analysis of the Ishikawa3 factors is unnecessary.\nMadsen, C.J.\n<",
